 Kirsi, protective but also loves to show her about the world/life she missed out on while isolated\n\nKirsi\n-4'9\" / 144 CM\n-immortal and cursed queen\n-calm, mature, gentle exterior, independent, soft spoken\n-isolated herself for 1000 years due to her curse\n\nit would be nice to have them in a fantasy setting but otherwise, I leave everything up to you!\n\nMore Art: https://argentkirsi-ref.carrd.co/#artworks\n\nhttps://argentkirsi-ref.carrd.co/#forevermore", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kazuno_y/works/73", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8fcb6c44/uploads/origins/9d47ccf6-f81b-4fdf-a07a-ed628f9399b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c28ab0c49b0db56c46bc708476c7605", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8fcb6c44/uploads/origins/9d47ccf6-f81b-4fdf-a07a-ed628f9399b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c28ab0c49b0db56c46bc708476c7605, https://si.imgix.net/8fcb6c44/uploads/origins/9d47ccf6-f81b-4fdf-a07a-ed628f9399b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b2f4c7213253a0015cb168f1d61b320 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8fcb6c44/uploads/origins/9d47ccf6-f81b-4fdf-a07a-ed628f9399b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=761bc382bf4f3363d76b7533d711ffc4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "またイラストをお願いさせていただきます！\n\n前回描いて頂いた若頭とお嬢のTwitterアイコンとヘッダーをそれぞれ別の絵でお願いしたいです！ヘッダーは二人が恋仲だとわかるような距離感だと嬉しいです！\n細かな構図や衣装はお任せします。\n\nこちらのイラストの二人です。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kazuno_y/works/61", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kazuno_y/works/72", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/16e95808/uploads/origins/3a5c6c8a-9b21-485d-a88c-3e9a41dd751b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=103d1c69dfeb35600a654137b5b87a21", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16e95808/uploads/origins/3a5c6c8a-9b21-485d-a88c-3e9a41dd751b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&